Docker (Compose)
================

Development with hot reload (Vite + pnpm):

```bash
# Build the dev image with compose
docker compose build
# Start the dev server
docker compose up
```

Compose details
---------------
- Service: `web` defined in [docker-compose.yaml](docker-compose.yaml).
- Port: `5173` published for Vite + HMR.
- Volumes: project mounted at `/workspace`; pnpm store cached in named volume `pnpm-store`.
- Env: polling enabled for reliable file watching in Docker (`CHOKIDAR_USEPOLLING`, `WATCHPACK_POLLING`).

# Installation instructions
Install nvm https://github.com/nvm-sh/nvm
Then install the latest LTS Node and enable pnpm via Corepack:

```
nvm install --lts
nvm use --lts
corepack enable pnpm
pnpm install
```

# Run
Use pnpm to start the dev server:

```
pnpm dev
```

# Test

```
pnpm test
```
